<https://ontology.irokosociety.org/iroko#generatesKinship> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "Links an InitiationEvent to the KinshipClaim it creates. Covers initiation-based human kinship bonds: godfather/godson (padrino/ahijado), initiator/initiate, elder/junior lineage member. Unlike assertsKinship, this bond is generated by a documented event of record rather than narrated — the initiation created the bond. Access: initiated-only — initiation genealogy and godparent lineage are internal community records not appropriate for public or community-tier disclosure."@en .
